          "settings": {
            "subheading": "For the Earth, For our Future"
          }
        },
        "heading_4REfNY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our Impact Journey",
            "use_h1": true
          }
        },
        "text_CTT4FF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As our brand grew, so did its purpose. Today, Loulou Lollipop is more than just a brand; it's a commitment to making a positive impact. Our founders, Angel & Eleanor, saw the opportunity to shape a future where business is not just about products, but about the well-being of people and our planet. This led to our journey towards becoming an impact business, embedding the ethos of sustainability and responsibility into every aspect of our operations.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_arWjcc",
        "heading_4REfNY",
        "text_CTT4FF"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_376A4029.png",
        "image_width": 700,
        "image_link": "",
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_KYxEte": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_7DN6Mq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>2023 was a big year for us, here at Loulou Lollipop, and we are over the moon to shout from the baby rooftops: <em><strong>We’re officially a B Corp!</strong></em></p><p> Imagine us doing the diaper dance of joy! This isn’t just any certification—it’s like winning a gold star in the world of businesses. We’ve pledged to meet the highest standard of social and environmental performance, making a legal commitment to be all about the people and the planet. </p><p> Joining the 7,500+ Certified B Corps worldwide has helped us become clear on how we are going to use our business as a force for good. We’re on a mission to make the world cozier and cuter. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_kpj4fB": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Learn more",
            "button_link": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1458/9446/files/Loulou_Lollipop_-_Impact_Report_2023.pdf?v=1704858416",
            "button_style": "primary"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_7DN6Mq",
        "button_kpj4fB"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/BCorp-certified-logo-loulou-lollipop-275.jpg",
